---
layout: layouts/list.njk
title: Tags
permalink: /tags/
description: Every topic, and how much has collected under it.
---
{# The topic index. Counts come from the same collection the stream renders,
   so a tag cannot show a number the stream has no notes for. #}
<h1>Tags</h1>

<p>
    The same notes as the <a href="{{ '/' | relative_url }}">stream</a>, sorted
    by what they are about instead of by when they were written. A note can
    carry several tags, so these add up to more than the stream does.
</p>

<div class="tag-grid">
    {%- for tag in collections.allTags %}
    <div class="tag-grid-item">
        <a href="{{ ('/tag/' + tag.name + '/') | relative_url }}">{{ tag.name }}</a>
        <small>{{ tag.count }}</small>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
</div>
